      "5": {
        "speaker": "terry",
        "line": "they said what?! What do we pay them for? I\u0027ll be frozen in **bleep** before I settle! Alright, let\u0027s try this again. Welcome .. new contractors. Today we have an exciting, new chall- They\u0027re full of mud. The pipes. And the lab says that\u0027s a bad thing. The last crew left with some explosives, use that. Don\u0027t get blown up, or do, you signed the contract.",
